<metadata><name>Galičica trail H-11</name><desc>H-11 is one of Galičica National Park's easier and shorter hiking trails. It's 6.4 km from above Trpejca (919 m) to above Lubanishta (1,056 m), with about 450 m of climbing and 318 m of descent in the direction drawn, between 802 m and 1,103 m. https://galicica.finereli.com/trails/h-11/</desc><link href="https://galicica.finereli.com/"><text>galicica.finereli.com</text></link><copyright author="NP Galičica (trail lines), OpenStreetMap contributors (places, G-6)"><license>https://galicica.finereli.com/about/#license</license></copyright></metadata>
